  <!-- EN: royal vivi -->
  <VV_RoyalVivi.label>皇家薇薇</VV_RoyalVivi.label>
  <!-- EN: This Vivi has transformed into a Royal Vivi.\n\nIt can reproduce by laying eggs and its lifespan is greatly increased. Mental strength and cognitive abilities are developed, but movement speed and work efficiency are reduced. -->
  <VV_RoyalVivi.description>这个薇薇已经成为了一个皇家薇薇。\n\n它可以通过产卵繁殖，寿命大大延长。脑力和认知能力得到了发展，但运动速度和工作效率降低了。</VV_RoyalVivi.description>
  
